Description: include the sound helper from its media2 path
 The legacy media helper header shipped at the top level of the old media
 kit include tree. V\OS media2 ships the same play_sound() API at
 media2/PlaySound.h -- the path the media2 kit's own sources use -- so
 the bare <PlaySound.h> include does not resolve on V\OS.
Author: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Origin: vendor
Last-Update: 2026-10-21
---
This patch header follows DEP-3: http://dep.debian.net/deps/dep3/

---
--- a/Application/BeTrisApp.cpp
+++ b/Application/BeTrisApp.cpp
@@ -25,7 +25,7 @@
 #include <TranslationUtils.h>
 #include <stdlib.h>
 #include <time.h>
-#include <PlaySound.h>
+#include <media2/PlaySound.h>
 #include <Entry.h>
 
 const char		*BETRIS_TETRINET_V114	= "1.14";
